            </note>
            <note corresp="#d113-f2" n="2" xml:id="d113-f2-content">
                <p>Presumably, the memorandum, <hi rendition="#italic">supra</hi>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d113-f3" n="3" xml:id="d113-f3-content">
                <p>Presumably, telegram 144, March 18, to New York, <ref target="#pg741">p.
